window.products.push({"id":1119029,"name":"French Butter Crock, Vidalenta Butter Dish with Lid for Countertop, Ceramic Butter Dish Keeper for Spreadable Butter, Butter Container Butter Keeper t","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tpUjbg+LL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NO LONGER BOTHERED BY HARD BUTTER: This porcelain butter crock offers you long lasting soft, fresh, durable, spreadable and tasty butter even without any need of refrigeration. The two-piece design features an inverted bell-shaped lid and crock base, and water makes an airtight seal between lid and crock, keeping your butter soft and spreadable while protecting against airborne dust particles, insects and bacteria. SAFE AND DURABLE PORCELAIN: The french butter crock is made of durable professional grade porcelain fired at high temperature using underglaze color process, lead-free, cadmium-free, chip-resistant, colorfast, and more sturdy than stoneware and plastic. You don't have to worry about harmful substances leaching into your food, and you can safely put this butter keeper in the refrigerator and dishwasher. 7.5 OZ BIG CAPACITY AND EASY TO USE: This french butter dish easily holds about 7.5oz of soft butter or your own homemade butter, which is very practical and suitable for family use. Pour cold water into the base of the crock to the water line, firmly cover the dry cover with softened butter, and then replace the cover with the base. Your butter is ready to use! An airtight seal protects and preserves butter’s flavor and freshness. TO USE BUTTER CONTAINER PROPERLY: 1. Make sure the lid is clean and dry before use. 2. Make sure you don't over-soften the butter before putting it in the crock. 3. Please use the back of a spoon to press it firmly, and Change the cold water every 1-2 days, daily if possible. 4. Keep the farmhouse butter crock away from heat sources (like the stove) and direct sunlight. PERFECT GIFT CHOICE: This butter crock for counter is well made and beautifully finished with gorgeous colors, non-slip design at the bottom, cute and easy-to-open hand-held butter lid, add creativity and interest to your home life. Safely packaged in a specially designed gift box, each porcelain butter dish is the perfect gift choice for housewarming, weddings, Thanksgiving and Christmas holidays. VIDALENTA'S PROMISE: We provide a free refund or replacement for any defective product. If you have any problems with our products after receiving them, please contact us first. We will make every effort to solve it for you because you are important to us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tpUjbg+LL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vidalenta","source_asin":"B0C6V4SM98","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1119029","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6V4SM98","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6V4SM98","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
