window.products.push({"id":1119157,"name":"Marco Almond® KYA28 Kitchen Knife Set, 14 Pieces Stainless Steel Cutlery Knives Sets for Kitchen with Block and Built-in Sharpener, Full Tang Knife Se","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VogfPAKiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Exclusive Built-in Sharpener】The kitchen knife set features silver knives, black knife block with built-in sharpener designed to keep knives at optimum sharpness every time you use them. The built-in sharpener saves you from having to honing blades on a sharpening steel. 【Value kitchen Knife Set】14 pieces knives sets for kitchen with block include: 1pc-8\" chef knife, 1pc-8\" slicing knife,1pc-5\" santoku knife, 1pc-5.5\" serrated utility knife, 1pc-5\"utility knife, 1pc-3.5\" paring knife, 6pcs 4.5\" serrated steak knives, 1pc-all-purpose kitchen shear and 1pc-black wooden knife block. 【Ultra Sharp Knives set】Each forged kitchen knife features high-carbon Japanese stainless steel blade which ensure the knife retains its ultra-sharp edge and makes cutting through food easy. This cutlery kitchen knife set is tarnished, rust-resistant and can withstand high-frequency use or use after long periods of idle. 【Outstanding Performance】 Optimized weight and good balance make this kitchen block knife set fit nicely in the palm of hand. Exclusive taper grind edge technology provides optimum sharpness for precise cutting and is easy to re-sharpen. Fantastic set of knives give kitchen a neat, nice, clean, and organized look. 【Ideal Gift】This knife block set is a perfect and practical present for your parents, neighbors, weddings, housewarming,Thanksgiving, Christmas, birthdays, Mother’s Day, Father’s Day, New Year, Valentine's Day, Easter or other special days. Home necessities for every family.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VogfPAKiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Marco Almond","source_asin":"B09Z2B4SQ4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1119157","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Z2B4SQ4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Z2B4SQ4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1119158,"name":"MOPALL Premium Vegetables Peeler for Kitchen, Potato Peeler with Rotating Head, Perfect Stainless Peeler For Veggies, Straight & y-Shaped Multi Kitche","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61soHh81-tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍠🍠As the leaves start to turn and the temperatures start to cool, we often think about the promise of the cooler months for our veg and fruits. Apple pie, cucumber, kiwi, carrot and cabbage salad, and mashed potatoes are all great options for seasonal meals. Peeling and slicing all kinds of veggie can be a chore, but like anything in the kitchen, there's usually a way to make it easier, and it comes down to the right tools - stainless steel wide crosswise swivel peelers 🍎🍎This is a double-sided peeler that is professional for home cooks who want an all-in-one device that provides both a serrated and straight peeling surface. The potato peeler has serrated and straight stainless steel blades that are sharp enough to easily peel the uneven surfaces of carrots and potatoes without stripping too much flesh from thin-skinned apples, and has a handy eye, Can remove blemishes from potatoes. It has a personal design for finger that makes it easy for peeling fruit. 🍑🍑There are two major camps in the world of peelers: straight swivel or Y-shaped. Straight swivel peelers are best for smaller produce such as carrots, Y-shaped peeler for its ability to cut through super thick skin and rinds. But for our small peeler, straight-shap and Y-shap conversion can be easily realized, just prees the button which after the peeler head, rotat the head when it have a distance between the head and the handle. 🥔🥔This unique peeler offers a serrated peeler that is adept at catching onto tough-to-penetrate skins (fuzzy, hard, or smooth), like tomatoes, sweet potatoes, and peaches. The serrated blade is also great for trimming tougher foods, like asparagus and squash. Because it's serrated, it leaves behind very fine ridges on the item that you’re peeling, which provides extra grip on your food to prevent slipping. 🍋🍋Manual peelers are available in a straight handle design or a Y-peeler. For the straight handles, the blade is parallel to the handle, so you’ll hold the blade on its side and work in a sideways fashion, sort of like you’re brushing hair. For a Y-peeler, the blade is perpendicular to the handle, so you’ll work in a more vertical motion, like you’re painting a wall top to bottom. Our vegetable peelers can meet the personal preferences of different people at the same time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61soHh81-tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MOPALL","source_asin":"B09XX8WYG9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1119158","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XX8WYG9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XX8WYG9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
