window.products.push({"id":1119229,"name":"Lolita Love My Wine Glass, Tie One On","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41JoT74WcBL._AC_.jpg","description":"To put it simply, at Santa Barbara Design Studio, we make what we love and we love what we make. The one and only…Lolita. It all started with a girls' night out. One that contained more than the usual laughter and fun. Browsing for the first time through a martini menu, Lolita was inspired by the recipes. After being served a Cosmopolitan, her creative imagination made her see the glass differently, the way she thought it should be, a bit more dressed up, perhaps with a pattern, with flair and with a fabulous recipe on the bottom. Lolita took hold of that original idea, hand painted martini glasses, and then took the world by storm in 2004 to become the hottest gift brand in the U.S. Now, after many successful products, designs and collections, she continues to stand behind what she has always believed...that life should be lived to its fullest and every moment should be celebrated. What is your moment? Commemorate it with a wine, margarita or martini glass, a shooter, rocks glass or pilsner. For whichever of life's big moments, there is a Lolita style to fit it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41JoT74WcBL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Santa Barbara Design Studio","source_asin":"B005CW8P0I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1119229","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005CW8P0I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005CW8P0I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
