window.products.push({"id":1119244,"name":"QLFJ-FurDec Portable Wardrobe Closet, 47 Inch Clothes Storage Organizer Shelves Rack with 2 Hanging Rods, Standing Closet for Hanging Clothes, Non-Wov","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yhXsLEbrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Space Saving Organizer】-- Great size of 46.5\"L x 17.7\"W x 66.5\"H, with 2 movable clothes hanging rod and 8 storage shelves, provides large storage space, load capacity up to 330lbs, not easily deformed. The multi-level partition design creates extra storage space instantly, ensure you enough space to place your clothes, accessories, bedding, lining, shoes, etc. 【Sturdy and Durable】-- To ensure higher durability and stability, our metal tubes are thickened, rust and corrosion resistant, strong enough to handle whatever you throw at it; And our PP connectors is lengthened and thickened, boasting greater strength, durability, and they are not easy to break or bent. 【Thickened Dustproof Cover】-- Zippered thickened non-woven cover with zipper closure is made of premium fabric, durable, anti-static, reusable and easy to clean with damp cloth, offered to keep your item away from dust. 【Easy to Assemble and Use】-- We provide a detailed installation manual, just be sure to read the assembly manual carefully before you start putting the wardrobe together, certain shelves must be installed in a particular order and please make sure all poles reach the bottoms of plastic connector holes. 【Lightweight and Portable】 -- Our wardrobe closet on its own is light weight, you can easily disassemble it, pack it up and reassemble at your destination. Easy access in bedroom, cloakroom, walk-in closet, clothing store, laundry room and more, great solution for your scattered clothes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yhXsLEbrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"QLFJ-FurDec","source_asin":"B0BCK3LWZG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1119244","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCK3LWZG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCK3LWZG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
