window.products.push({"id":1119290,"name":"Theuwnee® 2 Pcs Silicone Ice Cube Trays, Ice Cube Molds for Freezer with Lids, Easy Release Flexible-15 Cubes for Cocktail, Whiskey, Baby Food, Chocol","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GBbWAKa+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔PLATIN SILICONE MATERIAL: Unlike other products, we use platinum silica gel. Compared with common silica gel products on the market, our products have almost no peculiar odor, BPA-FREE, through FDA certification, and are more suitable for food contact and baby food supplements. ✔Stackable & Removable Cover Ice Cube Tray: This large ice cube tray features a removable cover that allows you to make beautiful cubes while preventing ice cubes from absorbing the refrigerator smell. In addition, they can be easily and neatly stacked in the fridge without sticking. ✔Easy Peel: Our product has the anti-adhesion design on the bottom. Each ice cube is pure cube and the silica gel is very soft. You don't have to wait for it to cool down. You can easily squeeze the ice cubes at any time without removing them firmly, so that the product can be used longer. ✔Large Ice: Each bowl contains a total of 15 cubes (6 x 11.5 x 4.3 cm) of 30 pieces each. You can fill the ice cube maker not only with water, but also with cocktails, whisky, red wine, fruit, puree and ice cream, dietary supplements, baby food or candles. ✔Theuwnee store specializes in the manufacture of ice cube molds and we guarantee the quality of the products. We only provide the best quality products, please rest assured to buy, welcome to enter the store to choose more styles.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GBbWAKa+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Theuwnee","source_asin":"B0B516G1VT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1119290","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B516G1VT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B516G1VT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
