window.products.push({"id":1119482,"name":"Bath Towels, Super Soft Bamboo Towels for Bathroom, Highly Absorbent Large Bath Towels 35 x 63 Inches, Quick Dry Multipurpose Use for Fitness,Spa,Spor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Wg4ZOu4KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❤️Premium Material: The bath towel set includes 2 pieces of 35x63 inch bath towels, each towel is made of high-quality bamboo fiber material and polyester, the bamboo bath towel is tough and durable, skin-friendly and breathable, and has a long service life. It still retains its original softness after multiple washes. ☁️Ultra Soft & Lint Free: The luxury bath towels reach a gram weight of 350 GSM, making the large bathroom towels extremely soft and thick. Bamboo fiber is woven with high-density technology, which improves the softness and plush of the towel, and maintains a certain friction force, quickly absorbing moisture when it touches your skin. Special plush and weave design will not lint. ✨Absorbent & Quick Drying: Bamboo bath towel is 1.5 times more absorbent than cotton, Great GSM and large Bath Towel Surface Area can provide better water absorption, Bamboo fiber mixed with polyester material makes the plush towels breathable and quick drying , saving drying time and avoiding wet stains and odor. 😊Multipurpose Use: Combining softness and strength, premium jumbo bath towels are comfortable and durable, making them perfect for a variety of life scenarios such as poolside, bathroom, spa, beach, salon,hotel, fitness center, kitchens and bedrooms, and even camping trips. 💕 Care Tips: Wash with cold water to remove excess lint and activate fibers to make it plusher before use. This thick bamboo towels is machine washable and can be dried at low temperature. After washing, it still remains soft, no lint, and no wrinkle. Please do not use bleach and do not iron.if you have any product problems can contact us at any time.(Please tear the package and leave it for a period of time to let the towel become fluffy before use.)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Wg4ZOu4KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SEISSO","source_asin":"B0BCXXH2T1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1119482","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCXXH2T1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCXXH2T1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
