window.products.push({"id":1119620,"name":"Maple's 12-Inch Moving Gear Wall Clock, Glass Cover","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-31Y20T3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This wall clock features visible moving gears. The plastic body is faced with a brushed aluminum dial. The clock has a mix of brushed aluminum and silver plastic gears that move continuously. A round plate glass cover is mounted on the front with numbers every quarter hour. The clock is 12-inch in diameter and 2-3/4-inch deep. Precision timing is kept with quartz crystal. The clock is powered by 2 c and 1 aa battery (not included) and includes a 1 year limited warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-31Y20T3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Maple's Clock","source_asin":"B008BGI430","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1119620","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008BGI430","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008BGI430","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1119621,"name":"Halloween Snow Globe Lantern Water Snow Globes Glittering with 6H Timer Halloween Lanterns Haunted House with Pumpkin Tombstone Witch Riding Broom and","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VqoLVtuZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Halloween Snow Globe: Halloween snow globe lantern is unique design and handmade, made of premium plastic material. The interior of the snow globe are made of resin and the coloring of the statues. It's easy for you to decorate the dining table, show window, fireplace, coffee table, nightstand which creates a unique atmosphere for Halloween holiday. Full of sparkling sequins, halloween glitter globe create a spooky atmosphere in your home. Halloween Lanterns Design: The halloween water globes haunted house with ghost, a black room with a witch riding a broom, an ugly tree, tombstones and a pumpkins, and when turn on the switch, there are snowflakes flying all over the sky and terrifying ghost calls, snow globes can well enhance an exciting festive atmosphere for your friends and lovely family. Two Power Models: Halloween snowglobe water lanterns glitter has two power supply methods, one way is powered by USB Cable (Included), the USB cable allows you to operate the ghost house Halloween globe without using the battery. You can also use 3 AA batteries (No Included), so you can place Halloween snowglobes any where you want. 6 Hours Timer: Halloween snow globes with music has three control modes: ON1 - OFF - ON2, when switch to ON1 mode, the musical snow globes lantern on with music and the glittering swirling for 6 hours and off for 18 hours, cycle every 24 hours automatically. When switch to ON2 mode, the Halloween water globe on without music but with timer. Halloween Lantern Decorations: Halloween floating water lanterns size is 71*3.7*10.1 inches, you can put it in any place you like, providing more choices for your bedroom, living room, bathroom and kitchen. Fall snow globe lantern bring the fun fall and halloween flair to any home or office space. The adorably spooky and realistic textures makes this piece a charming addition to your personal halloween décor collection.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VqoLVtuZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ROLAMAX","source_asin":"B0BD45D96F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1119621","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BD45D96F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BD45D96F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
