window.products.push({"id":1119976,"name":"ZENY Extra Wide Dresser Storage Tower - Storage Tower Unit for Bedroom, Hallway, Closet, Office Organization - Steel Frame, Wood Top, Easy Pull Fabric","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JBivKt0ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【5 Drawer Storage Chest】 — ZENY drawer chest complete with a wood surface and 5 collapsible drawers include 2 sizes to satisfy your different storage needs. This drawer organizer is multifunctional, storing all kinds of clothes in limited place; Organizing daily accessories in neat way. Ideal for closets, bedrooms, living room, nurseries, playrooms, entryways etc. 【Sturdy Structure & Foldable Drawers】— Combine MDF board with durable iron frame, made of breathable non-woven synthetic fabric. Cross support bar and drawer support shelf were added, will not shake under full load. Ajustable feet for uneven ground and protect the floor from scratches; easy pull handle for quiet opening and closing; removable drawers for easy storage. 【Keep Your Home Tidy】 — Wood top provides hard surface for displaying lamps, alarm clocks, books, eyeglasses, charging station, and more. 5 drawers great for storing clothes, blankets, linens, baby clothes, lingerie, purses, scarves, socks, accessories, gadgets, toiletries, cosmetics, hair/beauty products, paperwork, toys, knitting supplies, and household clutter,keep your home tidy and clean. 【Functional & Versatile】— Compact size plus large storage space, this cabinet is great for bedroom, living room dresser, guest room, closet, nursery, hallway, college dorm, small apartment solutions. Can be used as dressers for bedroom, storage cube dresser, 5 drawer dresser, small closet dresser, storage chest, living room dresser, sofa end tables, office supply storage, kids nightstand, or baby nursery table. More, it's beautiful design allows the cabinet to blend in seamlessly with any room. 【Easy to Assemble】— Simple structure makes it easy to assemble, which helps save your time. The entire unit is portable, lightweight, and easy to relocate to different spaces. Great storage solutions for home or office use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JBivKt0ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZENY","source_asin":"B0B48PG366","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1119976","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B48PG366","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B48PG366","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
