window.products.push({"id":1119992,"name":"HIBREW 3-in-1 Portable Espresso Maker for Car, Nes* Original/DG* Pod/Ground Coffee Compatible, 12 Volt Espresso Maker for Pods, 15 Bar, 2 oz, with Fol","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jsZMUEugL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【3 in 1 Compatible Design】 This portable coffee machine is perfectly compatible with the Nes* OriginalLine Capsule, DG* Capsule and Ground Coffee (Recommended grinding is Fine, it is suitable for Espresso). Multi-functional compatible innovative design allows you to have more choices. Notice: other types of capsules are not compatible. 【Lightweight & Compact】 The car coffee maker measures 2.7\" L x 2.7\" W x 9.4\" H, weight only 1.32 lb, with a convenient storage case and bracket. Suitable for travel, camping, driving, hiking, fishing, picnic, or RV. During the working day, it can also be your individual espresso maker in the office. Lightweight design without burden! 【One-click Simple Operation】 When using a USB Cable, add hot water, long press the power button switch for 2~3 seconds, then wait 60 seconds to complete the brewing. When using a Car Charger Adapter or an AC Adapter, add cold water or hot water, quickly press the switch for once, then wait 5~8 minutes to complete the brewing. Just a simple operation to taste a cup of 2 oz mellow coffee. 【15 Bar High Pressure Extraction】 This 12V coffee maker is equipped with a high pressure pump that provides 15 Bar pressure strength. Stable pressure ensures to extract high quality coffee from the coffee capsule/powder. Please enjoy a cup of espresso with fragrant crema every time for yourself. 【Easy to Clean】 Just add clean water, then run the travel coffee machine once without capsules, which can automatically clean inside of the machine. The capsule adapter and food-grade coffee cup can also be easily disassembled, just rinse with water.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jsZMUEugL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HIBREW","source_asin":"B0B2VK2ZY7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1119992","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2VK2ZY7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2VK2ZY7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
